    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like waiting for a scene though. it feels like im looking through a window at a world that doesnt even have a place for me. everyone else seems so tied to things—jobs, families, stupid little dramas. i look at them and i just feel... finished. like i've already seen the end of the story and there's nothing left to do but watch the credits roll.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
